 "strings": [
  "",
  "The Delaz Fleet's attack",
  "on the Fleet Review shook the",
  "Earth Federation, quite literally.",
  "History would record that it",
  "showed the Earth Federation no",
  "longer held even a fraction of",
  "its pre-One Year War strength.",
  "Earth Federation's worst blunder.",
  "In history, more often than not,",
  "an army that suffers such a blow",
  "is driven into reckless excess.",
  "And so it was",
  "with the Earth Federation, too.",
  "But that excess",
  "did not surface at once;",
  "it advanced quietly,",
  "ever so quietly.",
  "Later ages would credit Delaz",
  "because the Fleet Review raid",
  "was, in the end,",
  "only a smokescreen.",
  "Around the time",
  "of the Fleet Review raid,",
  "Delaz hijacked colonies",
  "bound for Side 3 under the colony",
  "reconstruction program.",
  "A colony drop",
  "was his true objective.",
  "And he layered feints",
  "even over that true objective.",
  "First, hard on the heels",
  "of his Fleet Review success,",
  "he presented demands to the",
  "Federation's leaders at Jaburo.",
  "Their details were lost later,",
  "when Jaburo vanished",
  "in a nuclear blast,",
  "but they were said to be",
  "utterly unacceptable.",
  "In that statement, it is said,",
  "he openly declared a colony drop",
  "on the moon.",
  "The moon is a huge body, yet",
  "unlike the Earth, its mass",
  "is not all that great.",
  "A colony falling onto it",
  "might, under some conditions,",
  "bring about the collapse",
  "of the moon itself.",
  "At once, the Earth Federation",
  "ordered the fleet left at Konpei",
  "Island to pursue the colony.",
  "From the moment the colony",
  "began to fall, a mere 10 minutes",
  "passed before the Konpei Island",
  "fleet set out in pursuit.",
  "This showed nothing less than",
  "that, however corrupt it was,",
  "the Federation still retained",
  "that much capability.",
  "At the same time, however,",
  "the Earth Federation Forces'",
  "space fleet chief, Admiral Collinny,",
  "sought to use this situation",
  "as the trigger to set in motion",
  "a certain plan he had",
  "long been preparing.",
  "He meant to do away with",
  "the cult of the Gundam.",
  "After the One Year War, \"Gundam\"",
  "became an idol in the Earth Sphere.",
  "At times it became hope,",
  "at times a threat.",
  "A single mobile suit.",
  "A legend, almost a fiction,",
  "that it could turn a war around.",
  "That pained Collinny.",
  "Say \"Gundam,\" and anything went,",
  "however rash--such was the mood.",
  "That air hung over the Federation.",
  "In a sense, that way of thinking",
  "would split the Federation...",
  "Yes, Collinny had been thinking",
  "this for a very long time.",
  "Many on Earth forget it,",
  "but not all the people of space",
  "are Zeon.",
  "Indeed, the people of space",
  "make up by far the larger share",
  "of the Federation's population.",
  "Yet the people of Earth exalt",
  "the Gundam as if it were",
  "their own guardian god.",
  "That is a dangerous thing.",
  "That attitude breeds slackness",
  "within the Federation,",
  "and resentment in Zeon.",
  "In the end, the Gundam GP02A",
  "was stolen",
  "because of Federation slackness,",
  "and Konpei Island was attacked",
  "because of the resentment",
  "born in Zeon.",
  "Bury the Gundam.",
  "That would, at the same time,",
  "wipe out what remained of the",
  "One Year War within the Federation.",
  "To do that, it was essential",
  "to purge the hawkish officers",
  "clinging to vested interests",
  "inside the Federation,",
  "and an economic plan was needed",
  "to rein in rival military cliques.",
  "That is why",
  "a man named Gene Collinny",
  "went out of his way to recruit",
  "John Cowen from engineering",
  "and, from economics,",
  "a man named",
  "Jamitov Hymem.",
  "Through them, he wished",
  "to purge the Earth Federation",
  "Forces into the shape",
  "of his own ideal.",
  "But contrary to his designs,",
  "Cowen, a true engineer, followed",
  "where his technical",
  "curiosity led him,",
  "and gave in to the temptation",
  "to build a Gundam himself.",
  "What must Collinny have felt",
  "when he saw the words",
  "\"Gundam Development Project\"?",
  "A man he had recruited himself",
  "was, of all things, trying",
  "to build a Gundam.",
  "What's more,",
  "with hardly any opposition,",
  "it had passed Parliament.",
  "It was proof that the idol",
  "of the Gundam had spread",
  "even into Parliament.",
  "From that moment, Cowen",
  "was already Collinny's target.",
  "First, Collinny cut Cowen off",
  "from his trusted men,",
  "the Albion crew.",
  "From then until his dismissal,",
  "Cowen never once learned",
  "what was happening",
  "to the Albion crew.",
  "At the same time, he ordered",
  "the 401st Patrol Squadron",
  "to relieve the Albion of duty,",
  "and by separating Cowen from",
  "his combat test unit,",
  "in effect forced the Gundam",
  "Development Project to a halt.",
  "All that remained was how",
  "to detain and dismiss Cowen.",
  "Detaining Cowen, himself",
  "the head of a military clique,",
  "would not be easy.",
  "He had to wait for his chance.",
  "So Collinny deliberately hid",
  "the colony interception plan",
  "from him, scheming for Cowen",
  "to come to him of his own accord.",
  "All went just as he intended.",
  "Cima Garahau of the Delaz Fleet,",
  "long his secret informant,",
  "was also acting",
  "exactly as planned.",
  "Based on her information,",
  "a flawless colony interception",
  "plan was nearly in place.",
  "His one miscalculation was",
  "that the Albion crew rebelled.",
  "The Albion crew's rebellion.",
  "It was likely something",
  "no faction had foreseen.",
  "Yes, perhaps not even",
  "the Albion crew itself.",
  "It was triggered by",
  "the colony's change of course.",
  "A colony bound for the moon,",
  "expected to fall on the moon.",
  "Suddenly, it changed course.",
  "Toward Earth, humanity's homeland!",
  "Yes, Delaz had not only used",
  "the Fleet Review as a diversion",
  "for the colony drop;",
  "he had even feinted with",
  "the colony drop's target.",
