  "Fleet was still slow to move,",
  "and so the only force",
  "in a position to catch the colony",
  "was the Albion crew, confined",
  "to base by order.",
  "Had it not been",
  "for such circumstances,",
  "the Albion crew would surely",
  "never have defied orders",
  "or begun to act",
  "on its own judgment.",
  "It acted, in the end,",
  "from the belief that only they",
  "could set things right--",
  "from what was, in a sense,",
  "heroism.",
  "By an instinctive sense of duty,",
  "the Albion crew",
  "broke from Jaburo's command",
  "and resolved, as a lone ship,",
  "to stop the Delaz Fleet.",
  "Taking with it the power to do so:",
  "the Gundam GP03.",
  "The Gundam GP03.",
  "In a different sense than GP02A,",
  "it was a machine created so that",
  "the Federation could devour",
  "the ghost of Zeon.",
  "Yes--a fierce One Year War battle.",
  "In the operation to take Solomon,",
  "the Federation met a monster MA:",
  "the Big Zam...",
  "The Gundam GP03",
  "was a machine built on the same",
  "concept as that Big Zam.",
  "The Big Zam was a mobile armor",
  "for base defense, armed with",
  "a strong barrier field that",
  "nullified beams, and mighty beam",
  "cannons that fired every way.",
  "And the Gundam GP03",
  "had inherited",
  "that very concept.",
  "A core Gundam, the Stamen,",
  "was completed by mounting",
  "the Orchis--",
  "a giant weapons container",
  "and high-mobility mega booster--",
  "to form a colossal",
  "mobile weapon over",
  "140 meters long.",
  "Its firepower and defenses",
  "outclassed a Magellan-class,",
  "its speed beat any mobile armor.",
  "Its strength",
  "matched a mobile suit battalion,",
  "and its running cost",
  "equaled 100 ordinary",
  "mobile suits, it is said.",
  "Without doubt, the mightiest mobile",
  "weapon of Universal Century 0083.",
  "In other words,",
  "this Gundam GP03 was",
  "a new white devil, made to dispel",
  "the nightmare of the Big Zam.",
  "The very act of developing",
  "such a mobile suit",
  "may, in a sense, symbolize",
  "the limits and the rancor",
  "of the Federation Forces itself.",
  "Either way, there was",
  "no doubt that, for the Albion",
  "crew, the GP03 was a power",
  "they could not do without.",
  "The Albion crew,",
  "learning of the colony drop,",
  "seized the Gundam GP03--",
  "a pure space-combat machine",
  "never sent for ground tests--",
  "with the help of the engineer",
  "Lucette Audevie.",
  "This woman",
  "was Nina Purpleton's colleague",
  "and her rival.",
  "Knowing the Gundam series was",
  "about to be sealed away,",
  "she may have helped them",
  "for one last moment of glory.",
  "Either way, thanks to her help,",
  "the GP03",
  "fell into the Albion crew's hands,",
  "and Lucette was shot dead",
  "by the military police.",
  "Unexpectedly, the last",
  "Gundam of this era",
  "became Lucette's legacy,",
  "left to her rival,",
  "Nina Purpleton,",
  "and the man Nina loved,",
  "Kou Uraki,",
  "who would fly it.",
  "All the same.",
  "This Gundam Development Project",
  "can only be described",
  "as cursed.",
  "Stolen by Zeon remnants,",
  "then stolen by its own side--",
  "truly, this Gundam series",
  "seems to love being stolen.",
  "Of those who took part in it,",
  "most either died",
  "or fell from grace.",
  "It was this GP03",
  "that the Albion crew carried.",
  "The Albion could not hold it",
  "in the first place,",
  "so rather than carried, it was",
  "more like escorted alongside.",
  "And now,",
  "before the colony's point of",
  "no return, as many designs met,",
  "the curtain was about to rise",
  "on the final battle.",
  "The Albion Crew Takes the Stage",
  "The Conspirators Take the Stage",
